ND_TIMEOUT)."] [404 5 "// pyi never sets the host's clock: the real-time clock is refused as to an unprivileged"] [405 5 "// process, the others are not settable (EINVAL), as Linux answers"] [420 4 "// the main thread's CPU clock id (MAKE_THREAD_CPUCLOCK of the process's tid), as musl computes it"] [424 51 "// time_sleep's audit, before the conversion (queue 536)"] [435 45 "// the GIL released, interruptible by a signal (PY6f)"] [563 4 "// a namespace's attributes (types.SimpleNamespace is not pyi's yet: sys.implementation is a module)"] [571 3 "// init_timezone as musl builds it (no HAVE_DECL_TZNAME): the zones of localtime at the start of the"] [572 3 "// current year (in units of 365.25 days) and half a year later, the southern hemisphere's reversed"]] :go/pos {:name [1 9] :package [1 1]} :go/semis [[54 24] [100 24] [128 31] [153 33] [157 23] [215 12] [215 25] [260 22] [269 24] [287 28] [381 28] [417 25] [424 36] [485 28] [489 47] [492 27] [510 28] [514 46] [517 27] [608 28]]} (go/file "builtins_time.go" :imports [


